<title>JAPAN: Sanwa Shutter to change rules for share buyback.</title>
<headline>Sanwa Shutter to change rules for share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanwa Shutter Corp said on Thursday it would change company regulations in order to carry out a planned buyback of up to 23 million of its shares.</p>
<p>The change, needed to be approved at an annual shareholders' meeting on June 27, would make the buyback scheme more flexible, the company said in a statement.</p>
